This package reads Windows Runtime metadata (.winmd, ECMA-335 CLI format)
and calls the Windows Runtime (combase.dll) through @node-ctypes/comtypes
and node-ctypes. It does not distribute any Windows component.

WinRT metadata and ABI conventions follow ECMA-335 and Microsoft's WinRT
specifications:
https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/uwp/winrt-components/
